、その最中、主人公に処女を捧げようと画策しているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14189","sourceWorkId":"13327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"陽介の一つ下の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学式で道に迷っていたところを陽介に助けてもらい、一目惚れをする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"助けてもらった時、お礼も言わぬ間に陽介が立ち去っていったので、ずっとその事が心残りだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りが激しい反面、思い立ったら猪突猛進な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中出しフェスティバルが開催されるのを知り、このお祭中に陽介へ処女を捧げようと画策する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45807"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14189","sourceWorkId":"13327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14189","sourceWorkId":"13327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14189","sourceWorkId":"13327","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/27230ee15d7af3f406429860a1086bf1c62c90a7f0919d7b82a580204ab4c6e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01413c19b94ee6dc0331055f9f099568a8d83d762ef0a17d4bb212e17f34a6ee.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"有河春花","creatorId":"vndb:s877","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s877","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s877","name":"春河 あかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:25968:45807:19159:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c37544","characterName":"坂上 睦美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"45808","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25968"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14190"],"vndbCharacterId":"c37544"},"originalCharacterName":"坂上 睦美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus